&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for strong backend engineers who love building reliable systems around fragmented, high-value data. Kalepa&#39;s platform ingests billions of highly unstructured data points every day, extracts precise information from them, and surfaces the insights insurers rely on for high-stakes decisions. As a Senior Backend Engineer, you&#39;ll own strategically important, complex pieces of that system with minimal oversight: the services, data models, pipelines, and evals at its center, and the external-facing APIs that power our customers&#39; core workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work at the intersection of AI and backend engineering, on a problem the industry hasn&#39;t solved effectively yet. You&#39;ll join a high-ownership team responsible for some of Kalepa&#39;s most business-critical infrastructure, and you&#39;ll help the engineers around you do their best work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary range&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We differentiate our North America salary ranges using two geographical zones:&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Zone 1&lt;/strong&gt; (New York and San Francisco) - $213,000 to $246,000*&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Zone 2&lt;/strong&gt; (all other locations in the US and Canada) - $192,000 to $246,000*&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are primarily a remote company with employees across the US, Canada, and Europe. Our HQ is in New York city.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This team is a mix of software engineers owning Kalepa’s IT integration platform (public APIs, control plane) and forward-deployed engineers who embed with clients to integrate atop Kalepa’s APIs. The team is tasked with ensuring Kalepa’s deployments are complete, high-quality, and conducive to self-service. The team will define clear criteria for deployment quality and build processes that raise that quality standard for every client. Where the codebase today limits extensibility, they plan and refactor for sustainability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership areas&lt;/strong&gt;: Kalepa’s Public APIs and external docs; auth/SSO/permissions; control plane &amp;amp; admin tooling for configuring clients; adapters into external systems that build against Kalepa’s Public API.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the scoping, design, and delivery of complex backend systems in Python on AWS: services, data models, and asynchronous pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and scale LLM-based systems that process large volumes of unstructured documents and data with precision and explainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design external-facing APIs and integrations with third-party systems that customers depend on.&lt;/li&gt;
