&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-w-id=&quot;b69e7c88-dbd0-8fe2-7a2b-d5d05af7ae4f&quot; data-wf-id=&quot;[&amp;quot;b69e7c88-dbd0-8fe2-7a2b-d5d05af7ae4f&amp;quot;]&quot; data-automation-id=&quot;dyn-item-career-description-2-input&quot; data-palette=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;Year 1 OTE: &lt;/strong&gt;$340K - $380K (uncapped commission/upside), guaranteed attainment for first two quarters of Year 1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location Preference:&lt;/strong&gt; This role may require up to ~50% travel depending on your location. You will be expected to spend several days per week meeting with clients and prospects in-person. There is a preference for Tri-state area or Chicago, but open to other geographies in CST or EST with access to a major airport.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kalepa is looking for an exceptional&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Accounts Director&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;with 10+ years of enterprise sales experience to help spearhead commercial growth and secure new relationships with leading US insurers. We are a VC-backed, remote-friendly startup delivering software to transform and disrupt commercial insurance. Our HQ is located in New York City.&lt;/p&gt;
